# Release image = API runtime closure for the PR Guardian wedge, the
# operational-intelligence triggers, and the control-plane worker (see
# Dockerfile, app/import_closure.py). topology/, remediation/, and resilience/
# ship because app/operations_api.py resolves blast radius from the topology
# store and the same image runs the opt-in Temporal remediation worker and the
# certification exercise suite. Nothing in product/ needs to be excluded any
# more; every consequential activity stays gated on
# EIP_TEMPORAL_REMEDIATION_WORKFLOWS=enabled. tests/test_image_import_closure.py
# keeps this file honest: any shipped module importing an unshipped package
# must be listed here.
#
# The Company Brain adapter is reachable only from tests: no shipped module
# imports product/pr_guardian/company_brain.py, so company_brain/ stays out of
# the release image and the adapter is excluded with it.
